Appendix A 1A post-stir rule-ന്റെ മുഴുവൻ stir 1..12 savedBowlSum -> one-based bowl-order rank schedule പരിശോധിക്കുന്ന clean Stage 1 probe. six old bowls ഓരോ stir-ലും synthetic M snapshot ആയി തന്നെ നിൽക്കുന്നു; bowl values ഇവിടെ commit ചെയ്യുന്നില്ല, അതിനാൽ ഇത് full post-stir state chain-ന്റെ പകരമല്ല. raw sum 6M ആകുന്നതിനാൽ savedBowlSum = 149*stir. ഓരോ stir-ലും saved value, rank എന്നിവ output ചെയ്യുന്നു.

Hamlet, M സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, stir number സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, 149 സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, 720 സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, savedBowlSum സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, rank സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, M doubling count സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, assignment, SAVE, output സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: constants.

Scene I: M നിർമ്മാണം.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: You are as good as the difference between a big big big big big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Hamlet and Ophelia]

Scene II: exact doubling.
Hamlet: Are you better than nothing?
Ophelia:
 If not, let us proceed to scene III.
Hamlet: You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
Ophelia:
 You are as good as the product of yourself and a big hero.
 Let us return to scene II.

Scene III: M minus one.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: 149, 720, stir 1.
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero:
 You are a big big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero:
 You are a big big big big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big big big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a big big big big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]

Act II: stir schedule.

Scene I: stir 1..12.
[Enter Juliet and Prospero]
Juliet: Am I better than the sum of a big big big hero and a big big hero?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to act III.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: savedBowlSum = SAVE(6M + 149*stir).
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Hamlet and the sum of a big big hero and a big hero.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of Romeo and Juliet.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: rank = 1 + regularMod(saved-1,720).
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Macbeth and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: next stir.
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero. Let us return to scene I.
[Exeunt]

Act III: completion marker.

Scene I: exactly twelve stir schedule rows were visited.
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero. Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
